---
title: "Ethics for Health Care Professionals"
code: "HLT-145"
category: "health"
credits: "2"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Focuses on ethical concepts of health care. Emphasizes confidentiality, maintaining patient records, personal appearance, professionalism with patients/clients, associates, and an awareness of health care facilities. Lecture 2 hours. Total 2 hours per week.
